<p>The purpose of the <strong class="selflink">TutorialRef</strong> template, to place a small box under each  segment of a tutorial, which adds up to 5 Links. This is meant to link  to pages that can extend a topic in the tutorial. The box shall not be  very prominent, but follow a noticeable pattern. 
</p><p>Often tutorials cut topics, and the reader does not know where  to find more information about a topic. Similarly links may be scattered throughout the tutorial. This template allows additional links which extend the topic and allows links to be collated in neat box.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Usage">Usage</span></h2>
<pre>
{{TutorialRef|Link1|Link2|Link3|Link4|Link5}}
</pre> 
<p>Note: The template must have a minimum of one link, Link1, but Link2 to Link5 are optional.
</p>
